an see the process time is very unstable, and so are e.g. animations, camera movement etc., anything that depends on `deltaTime`, which itself is also very unstable.\n\nAlso, the editor says the game is running on Metal 3.2, but supposedly macOS 26 comes with new Metal 4. Not sure where that value comes from, though:\n```\nGodot Engine v4.5.stable.mono.official.876b29033 - https://godotengine.org\nMetal 3.2 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Apple - Apple M3 Pro (Apple9)\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIt's reproducible in a completely empty project. To visualize the issue better, you can add an animated cube and just watch it, the animation will stutter.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110600/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110600/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}